   "name": "Zay Flowers",
   "pos": "WR",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-16T20:05Z",
   "shortComment": "Flowers (toe) has been cleared to play in Sunday's game at Cleveland.",
   "longComment": "The Ravens added Flowers to their injury report Thursday as a limited participant, and while he remained limited Friday, his game availability isn't in doubt. Tyler Huntley is making another start at quarterback with Lamar Jackson (ankle) ruled out again.",
   "details": null
  },
  {
   "id": "642642",
   "name": "Nick Vannett",
   "pos": "TE",
   "status": "Active",
   "date": "2026-10-15T23:46Z",
   "shortComment": "Vannett (knee) practiced in full Thursday.",
   "longComment": "Vannett was limited Wednesday, though after being upgraded Thursday, he is cleared to suit up in Week 6 versus Cleveland. With Matthew Hibner (hand) uncertain to play in Sunday's meeting with the Browns, Vannett could be on the field more than usual. However, he still likely won't have much of a role behind Mark Andrews and Josh Cuevas.",
